sec.p:
Given the weight vector W, the above objective is optimized during the prediction phase to provide the best assignments to the labels and link-labels for an input document. However, the output labels are not independent of each other and their value is constrained by the following constraints that originate from the definition of the labels of each template:
(10)\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
